      "text": "Let \\( f(x) = 3 x^{2} \\). The region R shown is bounded by the graph of f, the x-axis, and the vertical lines \\( x = 1 \\) and \\( x = 5 \\). Find the exact volume of the solid generated when R is revolved about the x-axis.",
